# Environment Rebuild Guide

## 1. Identity Reset
- New Apple ID  
- New email  
- 2FA enabled  
- All Google accounts removed  
- All apps migrated from Gmail → Apple  

## 2. Network Reset
- New router  
- New SSID  
- New Wi‑Fi password  
- Remote management disabled  
- Clean DNS (ISP or Cloudflare)  
- Tailscale installed for secure mesh networking  

## 3. Device Reset
- Factory reset  
- New Apple ID  
- New Wi‑Fi  
- No restored backups  
- Minimal apps installed  
- Permissions locked down  

## 4. Safe Data Migration
Only migrate:
- photos  
- videos  
- documents  
- screenshots  
- logs  

## 5. Retire Compromised Devices
- Motorola Edge 50 offline  
- Old Androids offline  
- Old router offline  

## 6. App Reintroduction
Installed apps:
- App Privacy Report Analyzer  
- Tailscale  
- Custom Shortcuts for live analytics  
- Banking apps  
- Messaging apps  
- Social apps  

Avoid:
- trading apps  
- offshore brokers  
- “signals” apps  
- anything tied to iFX / NEXTART  
